# Smart Money Profiler Skill

When the user asks for smart-money profiling, capital-actor profiles, LHB seat identity, active seat tracking, institution-seat behavior, northbound cross-period behavior, capital consensus or divergence, or who is buying and selling an A-share name, use the local skill package.

Preferred local project path:

```text
.cursor/skills/smart-money-profiler
```

Workflow:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/smart-money-profiler/SKILL.md`.
2. For seat-label dictionaries, profile schema, win-rate or holding-period formulas, consensus or divergence rules, report format, empty-data handling, or QA, also read `.cursor/skills/smart-money-profiler/references/profiling-playbook.md`.
3. Treat `.cursor/skills/smart-money-profiler/profiles/seats.json` as a persistent profile archive that may be read or updated when the user asks for saved seat profiles.
4. Use the local `pandadata-api` skill for exact method contracts before any real API call.
5. Preserve source method names, query parameters, data dates, seat-label evidence, inference labels, formulas, and missing-data notes.
6. Do not invent data interfaces, credentials, fields, official identity labels, predictive claims, or investment advice.
